 },
 "summary": "Three PNP silicon transistors for general use in the three-lead SOT-23 surface-mount case (CASE 318, style 6). All share a 45 V collector-emitter rating, 500 mA continuous collector current and 225 mW dissipation on an FR board; they are sorted by DC current gain at 100 mA: 100 to 250 for -16, 160 to 400 for -25 and 250 to 600 for -40. Each comes on 3000-piece or 10,000-piece reels, and every number has an S-prefixed twin that is AEC-Q101 qualified and PPAP capable for automotive use. The parts are lead-free, halogen-free and RoHS compliant. BC807-25LT1G is the -25 gain group on a 3000-piece reel, marked 5B1.",
